# PulseChat Environment Variables (Optional)
# If left empty, the application runs automatically in Interactive Local Demo Mode with zero configuration.
# To connect your own live Supabase project, provide your project credentials below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-public-key-here
